#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"list of values that are accepted as sector sizes (B<mkfs.btrfs --"
"sectorsize>) by the running kernel"
msgstr ""

#. type: TP
